<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss launch three-month money market claims.</title>
<headline>Swiss launch three-month money market claims.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss federal government is issuing three-month money market claims to be paid for on April 3, the Swiss National Bank said.</p>
<p>The allocation follows the end of subscriptions on April 1.</p>
<p>The previous issue of three-month claims, paid for on March 27, raised 1,181.8 million francs and was priced at 99.560 percent to yield 1.748 percent annually.</p>
<p>-- Zurich editorial, +41 1 258 7340</p>
</text>
